1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Nobody warns you: divorce takes the couple-friends with it.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Not from malice.
From logistics. The dinners were couple-shaped.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,000
So you're rebuilding a social life
from scratch at 40+.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Skip the reinvention montage. You don't need a new personality.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:22,000
You need a rhythm: one recurring event, one follow-up,
one ordinary week at a time.

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Quiet. Repeatable. Yours.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Join the Orbit beta. Link in bio.
